WEBVTT

00:21:04.935 --> 00:21:10.685
(Music)

00:21:11.649 --> 00:21:18.608
(Music)

00:21:20.269 --> 00:21:23.113
Early in my career,
I was hiring salespeople.

00:21:23.137 --> 00:21:25.526
One candidate had an unusual resume.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.237
He was a math major
who built robots for fun.

00:21:28.863 --> 00:21:30.883
In the first few minutes of the interview,